# The build needs exactly two things from this repo: the package manifest and
# docker/. Everything else is working data — scripts/*/data-raw/sources/ alone is
# ~4.3 GB (MethylCap matrices, the Ensembl v105 sqlite), and sending it to the
# daemon would make every build crawl for no reason.
#
# Whitelist style: ignore everything, then un-ignore the two paths. A blocklist
# would silently start shipping gigabytes the first time someone adds a new
# sources/ directory.
*

!docker/
!docs/environment/package_versions.tsv

# Belt and braces, in case the whitelist above is ever loosened.
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
